# Implementation Plan - Backend Validation Integration & Documentation Update

Align the frontend components, form validations, error handling, and documentation with the backend validation changes committed in `3881edb` (`Server Validation`).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Gender Case Sensitivity**: Backend `@Pattern(regexp = "Male|Female|Other")` is case-sensitive. The frontend `Profile.jsx` select element used `MALE`, `FEMALE`, `OTHER`, which will be updated to `Male`, `Female`, `Other`.
> - **Missing Email Field**: `CreateEmployee.jsx` was missing the `email` field required by backend's `EmployeeRequest` (`@NotBlank`, `@Email`). This field will be added to the UI.
> - **Account Opening Page**: `Accounts.jsx` was empty and missing from `App.jsx` routes despite being linked from `CustomerDashboard.jsx`. We will implement this with `initialDeposit` (Min 1000) validation.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend Error Utility & API Service

#### [NEW] [errorHandler.js](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/utils/errorHandler.js)
- Utility function to extract field-level or text validation messages from Spring Boot backend error responses.

#### [NEW] [accountService.js](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/api/accountService.js)
- Axios API helper for Account Service running on `http://localhost:8084` (`/accounts/open`, `/accounts/me`).

---

### Frontend Components & Pages

#### [MODIFY] [CreateEmployee.jsx](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/pages/admin/CreateEmployee.jsx)
- Add `email` state and input field to match `EmployeeRequest` DTO.
- Enforce validation rules: `username` (4-20 chars), `password` (min 6 chars), `email` (valid email format).
- Render field errors and backend validation response messages.

#### [MODIFY] [RegisterCustomer.jsx](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/pages/employee/RegisterCustomer.jsx)
- Enforce validation rules: `username` (4-20 chars), `password` (min 6 chars).
- Render field errors and backend validation error feedback.

#### [MODIFY] [Profile.jsx](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/pages/customer/Profile.jsx)
- Change dropdown values from `MALE`/`FEMALE`/`OTHER` to `Male`/`Female`/`Other`.
- Add client-side validation:
  - `firstName` & `lastName`: 2-30 chars, letters only (`^[A-Za-z ]+$`).
  - `email`: Valid email format.
  - `mobile`: 10 digits starting with 6-9 (`^[6-9]\d{9}$`).
  - `dateOfBirth`: Required, past date, age must be >= 18 years.
  - `gender`: Required (`Male`, `Female`, `Other`).
- Render inline field error messages.

#### [MODIFY] [Kyc.jsx](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/pages/customer/Kyc.jsx)
- Add client-side validation:
  - `aadhaarNumber`: Exactly 12 digits (`^\d{12}$`).
  - `panNumber`: 10-char uppercase PAN format (`^[A-Z]{5}[0-9]{4}[A-Z]$`).
  - `address`: 10-250 characters.
- Auto-uppercase PAN input.
- Render inline field error messages.

#### [MODIFY] [Accounts.jsx](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/pages/customer/Accounts.jsx)
- Build Open Account component with `initialDeposit` validation (min 1000, required).
- Show list of user accounts returned from `GET /accounts/me`.

#### [MODIFY] [App.jsx](file:///d:/CDAC/Project/Banking-Project/ProjectFrontend/bank-frontend/src/App.jsx)
- Register route `/customer/accounts` linking to `Accounts.jsx`.

